<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    C/S =  7.64%			 C/S =  8.49%</p>
<p>	    O/N =  7.64%			 O/N =  6.37%</p>
<p>	    T/N =  9.34%			 T/N =  7.65%</p>
<p>		   Dec  26, 1996			Dec  24, 1996</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  8.49%	1 month forward =  8.15%</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  8.32%	2 month forward =  7.99%</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  8.94%	3 month forward =  8.15%</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  8.49%	4 month forward =  8.33%</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  8.15%	5 month forward =  8.09%</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  7.87%	6 month forward =  7.82%</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
